---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PageHero from "../components/PageHero.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Managed Social — TMKE"
  description="A fully managed social media service for estate agents and property brands ready to outsource. Strategy, content, and consistent execution — done for you."
>
  <PageHero
    chapter="Services — Managed Social"
    title="Hand it over. <em>Stay in business.</em>"
    sub="A fully managed social channel for agencies who know marketing matters but don't have the time, the people, or the patience to manage it day to day."
  />

  <!-- Who it's for -->
  <section class="svc-section svc-section--two wrap">
    <header class="svc-section-head">
      <div class="svc-eyebrow">01 — Who it's for</div>
      <h2 class="svc-h">Agencies who care, but can't carry the channel themselves.</h2>
    </header>
    <div class="svc-body">
      <p>
        You know consistent social is what separates the agencies winning instructions from the
        ones still cold-calling. You've tried hiring an in-house junior, you've cycled through three
        freelancers, and the channel still looks like a graveyard half the time. Sound about right?
      </p>
      <p>
        Managed Social is for property brands — boutique to ten-office — that want the channel
        treated like the marketing asset it is, by people who only work in property and only do this.
      </p>
      <ul class="svc-list">
        <li>Independent estate agents going from 1 to 3 branches</li>
        <li>Lettings teams who don't want to dilute the sales brand</li>
        <li>Property developers wanting a single, on-brand voice across launches</li>
        <li>New-build marketing suites with no internal content function</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What's included -->
  <section class="svc-section wrap">
    <header class="svc-section-head svc-section-head--centred">
      <div class="svc-eyebrow">02 — What's included</div>
      <h2 class="svc-h">Everything the channel needs. Nothing it doesn't.</h2>
    </header>
    <div class="svc-grid">
      <article class="svc-card">
        <div class="svc-card-num">i.</div>
        <h3>Monthly content strategy</h3>
        <p>Themes, pillar mix, planned launches and seasonal moments mapped onto a real calendar.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="svc-card">
        <div class="svc-card-num">ii.</div>
        <h3>Post production</h3>
        <p>Designed posts, reel covers, story templates and carousels — all in your house style.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="svc-card">
        <div class="svc-card-num">iii.</div>
        <h3>Copywriting</h3>
        <p>Captions written by people who have actually read your last six listings. Property voice, no fluff.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="svc-card">
        <div class="svc-card-num">iv.</div>
        <h3>Posting &amp; scheduling</h3>
        <p>Scheduled across Instagram, LinkedIn and Facebook at the times your audience is actually scrolling.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="svc-card">
        <div class="svc-card-num">v.</div>
        <h3>Community management</h3>
        <p>Replies, DMs and comments handled in your tone — escalated to you only when they should be.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="svc-card">
        <div class="svc-card-num">vi.</div>
        <h3>Monthly reporting</h3>
        <p>A short, honest read — what worked, what didn't, what we're testing next month.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Approach -->
  <section class="svc-section svc-section--two wrap">
    <header class="svc-section-head">
      <div class="svc-eyebrow">03 — Our approach</div>
      <h2 class="svc-h">Slow to onboard, fast forever after.</h2>
    </header>
    <div class="svc-body">
      <ol class="svc-steps">
        <li>
          <strong>Discovery (week 1).</strong>
          A 60-minute deep-dive with the principals. We come away knowing your brand,
          your market positioning, and the listings types you actually want more of.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Brand &amp; system build (weeks 2–3).</strong>
          We build the templates, voice guide, scheduling system and approval workflow.
          You sign off on a sample month before anything goes live.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>First live month (week 4 onwards).</strong>
          The channel starts publishing. You get a Slack/WhatsApp line into the team
          for anything urgent and a weekly summary so nothing surprises you.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Quarterly reset.</strong>
          Every 90 days we step back, look at what's working, retire what isn't,
          and refresh the plan. No autopilot, no bloat.
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Investment -->
  <section class="svc-section wrap">
    <header class="svc-section-head svc-section-head--centred">
      <div class="svc-eyebrow">04 — Investment</div>
      <h2 class="svc-h">A retainer, not a price list.</h2>
    </header>
    <div class="svc-invest">
      <p>
        Pricing is set per engagement based on volume, channel count, and how custom the brand work needs to be.
        Most agencies invest somewhere between <strong>£2,000 and £6,000 per month</strong>, billed in advance,
        rolling monthly after the first 90 days.
      </p>
      <p>
        Discovery calls are free, last 30 minutes, and end with a quote or an honest "we're not the right fit."
        Both are equally welcome.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="svc-cta wrap">
    <h2>Book the call.</h2>
    <p>A 30-minute conversation — no slides, no sales script. Just listings, channel honesty, and a quote.</p>
    <a href="/contact" class="svc-cta-btn">Book a discovery call &rarr;</a>
  </section>

  <style is:global>
    .svc-section {
      max-width: 1280px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 100px 36px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(28,29,34,0.1);
    }
    .svc-section:last-of-type { border-bottom: 0; }
    .svc-section--two {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.4fr;
      gap: 80px;
      align-items: start;
    }
    @media (max-width: 880px) {
      .svc-section { padding: 60px 22px; }
      .svc-section--two { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 32px; }
    }

    .svc-section-head { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; }
    .svc-section-head--centred {
      max-width: 720px;
      margin: 0 auto 60px;
      text-align: center;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .svc-eyebrow {
      font-family: var(--sans);
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.28em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--english-violet);
    }
    .svc-h {
      font-family: var(--serif);
      font-size: clamp(34px, 4vw, 56px);
      line-height: 1.04;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--ink);
      font-weight: 500;
    }
    .svc-body p {
      font-family: var(--serif);
      font-size: 19px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: rgba(28,29,34,0.78);
      margin: 0 0 18px;
      max-width: 60ch;
    }
    .svc-body p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

    .svc-list {
      list-style: none;
      padding: 0;
      margin: 24px 0 0;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 10px;
      max-width: 60ch;
    }
    .svc-list li {
      position: relative;
      padding-left: 22px;
      font-family: var(--sans);
      font-size: 15px;
      color: rgba(28,29,34,0.7);
      line-height: 1.55;
    }
    .svc-list li::before {
      content: "—";
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      color: var(--english-violet);
    }

    .svc-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 22px;
    }
    @media (max-width: 980px) { .svc-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } }
    @media (max-width: 560px) { .svc-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
    .svc-card {
      padding: 32px 28px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
      border: 1px solid rgba(28,29,34,0.1);
      border-radius: 3px;
      min-height: 220px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 8px;
    }
    .svc-card-num {
      font-family: var(--serif);
      font-style: italic;
      font-size: 24px;
      color: var(--english-violet);
    }
    .svc-card h3 {
      font-family: var(--serif);
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: -0.015em;
      margin: 4px 0 6px;
      color: var(--ink);
    }
    .svc-card p {
      font-family: var(--sans);
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.55;
      color: rgba(28,29,34,0.65);
      margin: 0;
    }

    .svc-steps {
      list-style: none;
      padding: 0;
      margin: 8px 0 0;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 24px;
      counter-reset: step;
      max-width: 64ch;
    }
    .svc-steps li {
      position: relative;
      padding-left: 56px;
      font-family: var(--serif);
      font-size: 17px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: rgba(28,29,34,0.75);
      counter-increment: step;
    }
    .svc-steps li::before {
      content: counter(step, decimal-leading-zero);
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      top: 2px;
      font-family: var(--sans);
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.24em;
      color: var(--english-violet);
      width: 40px;
    }
    .svc-steps li strong {
      color: var(--ink);
      font-family: var(--sans);
      font-size: 13px;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      font-weight: 700;
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .svc-invest {
      max-width: 720px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .svc-invest p {
      font-family: var(--serif);
      font-size: 19px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: rgba(28,29,34,0.78);
      margin: 0 0 18px;
    }
    .svc-invest p strong { color: var(--ink); }

    .svc-cta {
      max-width: 880px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 100px 36px 160px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .svc-cta h2 {
      font-family: var(--serif);
      font-size: clamp(40px, 5vw, 72px);
      line-height: 1.02;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      margin: 0 0 16px;
      color: var(--ink);
      font-weight: 500;
    }
    .svc-cta p {
      font-family: var(--serif);
      font-size: 19px;
      line-height: 1.55;
      color: rgba(28,29,34,0.65);
      max-width: 540px;
      margin: 0 auto 36px;
    }
    .svc-cta-btn {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
      padding: 16px 26px;
      background: var(--ink);
      color: var(--paper);
      border-radius: 2px;
      font-family: var(--sans);
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.24em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: background 0.25s;
    }
    .svc-cta-btn:hover { background: var(--english-violet); }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
